<title>USA: Bolivia to seek 23,250 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat.</title>
<headline>Bolivia to seek 23,250 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia will seek about 23,250 tonnes of U.S. No.2 or better hard red winter wheat under PL 480, Title I, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>Delivery dates are slated for October 1-25 or at buyer's option November 1-15.</p>
<p>Offers to be submitted on September 12 and to be valid until September 13.</p>
<p>The wheat must originate in areas of the U.S. where karnal bunt (Tilletia Indica) is not known to occur.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
